      "tr": "Payı `Counter(labels)[c] / len(labels)` ile bul.",
      "en": "Find the share with `Counter(labels)[c] / len(labels)`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "`{c: round(math.log(...), 3) for c in sorted(counts)}`.",
      "en": "`{c: round(math.log(...), 3) for c in sorted(counts)}`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı:\n\n```python\nimport math\nfrom collections import Counter\n\n\ndef log_priors(labels):\n    counts = Counter(labels)\n    return {c: round(math.log(counts[c] / len(labels)), 3) for c in sorted(counts)}\n\nprint(log_priors([\"pos\", \"pos\", \"neg\", \"pos\"]))\n```",
      "en": "The full solution:\n\n```python\nimport math\nfrom collections import Counter\n\n\ndef log_priors(labels):\n    counts = Counter(labels)\n    return {c: round(math.log(counts[c] / len(labels)), 3) for c in sorted(counts)}\n\nprint(log_priors([\"pos\", \"pos\", \"neg\", \"pos\"]))\n```"
    }
